message: "If you use these criteria, please cite them as below."
title: "Conformity Criteria for Third-Party Audit of AI System Outputs"
abstract: "Open, tool-agnostic criteria (C1-C6) stating requirements that any AI output-governance mechanism should be able to demonstrate. The criteria are agnostic to vendor, architecture and implementation, and conformity is assessed against evidence a third party can obtain and check independently of the system's author."
